          "whatIsNotKnown": "Candidate investigation; not a user-selected topic or established novel gap.",
          "test": "Compare plain motion, visual gain and visual-plus-audio cues. Use one framing/stop task with identical controller and simulated-plant dynamics. Measure overshoot, jerk, task time and true-state understanding.",
